  "danbooruGuideTitle": "Connecting Fern to Danbooru",
  "danbooruGuideIntro": "Danbooru gives every account an API key so programs can read on its behalf. You take it from your profile; your password is never involved.",
  "danbooruGuideStep1": "Open your profile with the button below and make sure you are signed in.",
