  "danbooruGuideStep3": "If there is none yet, press \"Add\" and give it any name. One key is enough for Fern.",
  "danbooruGuideStep4": "Copy the long string it shows you.",
  "danbooruGuideStep5": "Come back here: the username is the same one you sign in with, and the key goes in the second field — not your password. Danbooru accepts it and simply returns nothing.",
